NOTICE — attributions this resource owes upstream
=================================================

Media / MediaDB redistributes and reformats data from the sources below. This file is the
project-level attribution; every individual record additionally carries its own source,
citation and licence in its `provenance` block, and the machine-readable schedule is
tools/licenses.tsv.

Record counts are of 13,515 media and are resolved from each record's own provenance
evidence (URL host, DOI, citation text), not from its filename. Counts and terms were last
verified on 2026-09-06.


