MediaDB — 471 media
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MediaDB: a database of microbial growth conditions in defined media.
Price Lab, Institute for Systems Biology, Seattle WA, and the University of Illinois at
Urbana-Champaign.
https://mediadb.systemsbiology.net/defined_media/

  Terms read from that page on 2026-09-06 (first-party). The only statement on it is:
  "(c) 2014, Institute for Systems Biology, All Rights Reserved". No reuse grant of any kind
  is offered. Contact: mediadb@systemsbiology.org

  MediaDB was previously absent from this project's documentation entirely — from the README
  source table and from its headline list of sources — while supplying 8,397 of the 14,341
  non-null concentration values in the library (58.6%), its single richest seam of
  quantitative data, under the most restrictive terms of any source. That omission is
  corrected here. The records are retained, labelled all-rights-reserved and excluded from
  the commercially usable subset, pending written permission.


